│     │                                                                                                         █│     │
│Follo│Track Assignment                                                                                         █│     │
│  Pat│  :sample assign [TRACK] assigns the loaded sample to a track                                            █│     │
│Scrol│  :sample replace [TRACK] swaps the track sample and prunes the old reference                            █│     │
│  Pag│  :sample unassign [TRACK] clears the track sample and instrument assignment                             ║│     │
│     │  TRACK is 1-based; omitted TRACK means the current track                                                ║│     │
│Edit │  :sample assignments lists track=sample mappings                                                        ║│     │
│     │                                                                                                         ║│     │
│     │Instrument Column                                                                                        ║│     │
│     │  Assigning a sample creates a sample-backed instrument for that track                                   ║│     │
│     │  Cells can override the track default with INST, e.g. :cell instrument 01                               ║│     │
│     │  An empty INST field uses the track instrument or sample assignment                                     ║│     │
│     │  :preset instrument save|show|load PATH for portable instrument files                                   ║│     │
